 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
-*   **Tunneling:** If $\Delta t$ is too large, the ray may jump over thin geometry between samples [S2, S4].
-*   **Performance:** If $\Delta t$ is too small, excessive samples are taken in empty space, causing performance loss [S2].
